<title>MALAYSIA: BANK NEGARA'S RESERVES 61.41 BLN RINGGIT AT JULY 3.</title>
<headline>BANK NEGARA'S RESERVES 61.41 BLN RINGGIT AT JULY 3.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Negara's gold, foreign exchange and other reserves fell to 61.41 billion ringgit as of July 31, against 61.90 billion on July 15, the central bank said in a statement.  </p>
<p>The central bank said its total assets and liabilities were at 98.84 billion ringgit from 96.82 billion two weeks earlier. (In bln ringgit)</p>
<p>			July 31 1997    July 31 1996    July 15 1997</p>
<p>    Reserves		61.41		67.26	     61.90</p>
<p>    Assets		  98.84		95.20	     96.82</p>
<p>    Currency		21.85		19.61	     22.07</p>
<p>    Govt paper	     1.82		 2.70		1.72</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
